# FAIL-OPEN 回歸：四個相異 domain ＋ 一筆重複，總數仍是 5
#
# 這是比 grade-domains-not-distinct 更陰險的版本：資料看起來很正常
# （五筆評級、四個不同 domain），只有 publication-bias 沒被評到，
# 而 imprecision 被評了兩次。`sh:minCount 5` 完全擋不住。
#
# 重複評級本身也是問題：同一個 domain 有兩筆不同評級時，以哪一筆為準是
# 未定義行為。Core 的 qualifiedMaxCount 1 一併擋掉。
#
# @expect-core: PS-gradeDomainPublicationBias, PS-gradeDomainImprecision
# @expect-sparql: SynthesizedClaimGradeShape
@prefix ahig: <https://ahig.local/ns/> .

<urn:ahig:canary:claim-missing-domain> a ahig:SynthesizedClaim ;
    ahig:riskTier "general-clinical" ;
    ahig:status "draft" ;
    ahig:certainty "low" ;
    ahig:certaintyDerivation "deterministic-rule" ;
    ahig:studyCount 14 ;
    ahig:gradeDomainRating <urn:ahig:canary:md-1>, <urn:ahig:canary:md-2>,
                           <urn:ahig:canary:md-3>, <urn:ahig:canary:md-4>,
                           <urn:ahig:canary:md-5> .

<urn:ahig:canary:md-1> ahig:domain "risk-of-bias" ;  ahig:rating "not-serious" .
<urn:ahig:canary:md-2> ahig:domain "inconsistency" ; ahig:rating "serious" .
<urn:ahig:canary:md-3> ahig:domain "indirectness" ;  ahig:rating "not-serious" .
<urn:ahig:canary:md-4> ahig:domain "imprecision" ;   ahig:rating "not-serious" .
# 重複的 imprecision，publication-bias 從缺
<urn:ahig:canary:md-5> ahig:domain "imprecision" ;   ahig:rating "serious" .
